I finally made it!! And now my obligatory post with stats,
recommendations, and also a few observations/questions:

Stats--Chaotic Priestess
       25/18/18/16/21/15 280HP 316Pw -23AC(-30 at max)
       5.2 million points, carrying 161 gems
       89,000+ moves (I was REALLY cautious!)
       All the right armor
       Weapons: Stormbinger & Vorpal Blade (as needed)
       died once (on Astral Plane)
       killed 3785 beasts:
           Wizard 12 times (I had +3 boots of speed)
           Pestilence 17 times (what a pain!)
           167 Wraiths (with NO tricks) 
           genocided L's early & V's later on
       Personal choice not to save files or polypile 
       Caveat: found WoW on level 2 ;)

Recommendations--No real gripes.  I think the game is well
written and quite balanced.  As many others have stated, the
mid-game is rather boring (tedious?) but I think that it's due
to the fact that we all want the perfect character (armor,
weapons, stats) and it takes time to do this.  Note: I've been at
the game for a couple years.

There is one thing I noticed though, the Elementals and
Vorticies on the earth, fire and water planes are nothing 
compared to the VERY dangerous Air Elementals.  I say beef up the
other Elementals :)  The Astral Plane is truly awesome!!

Observations/Notes--

1) Priest Quest gives too much benefit.  I went in at level 14,
and came out at level 27!!  Too many Wraiths throws off the
balance here.

2) I was never named chaotic equivilent to Envoy of Balance --
can someone tell me what this is called? --  I offered a lot and
made large batches of holy water, but didn't get the ultimate
blessing/curse (depending who you ask). 

3) I was occasionally blasted by Stormbringer's power even though
piously aligned as chaotic.  Why?

4) Once during double-trouble, one Wiz was a "@" and the other a
"e".  A feature or a bug?  (I nuked them both :)

5) Next time I'll have two blessed unicorn horns ready for the
end game.

6) Is 89,000 moves near a record?

7) Any statistics on divorces, lost jobs, failed degrees...  My
bed is now the dog house - I'd better curb my addiction...

Keep hacking!

